1
00:00:00,759 --> 00:00:03,179
(Raj:)-Shall I wait?
-Yes, please.

2
00:00:16,066 --> 00:00:18,316
(Sheldon:)How may I help you?

3
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:21,740
(Raj:)I've reconsidered your offer
to let me work with you.

4
00:00:22,113 --> 00:00:23,573
(Sheldon:)For me.

5
00:00:24,449 --> 00:00:25,829
(Raj:)Yes, for you.

6
00:00:26,201 --> 00:00:28,121
(Raj:)I do, however, have a few conditions.

7
00:00:28,411 --> 00:00:31,831
(Raj:)First, at all times, I am to be treated
as a colleague and an equal.

8
00:00:31,998 --> 00:00:34,998
(Raj:)Second, my contributions shall be noted
in published materials.

9
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:40,590
(Raj:)Third, you are never allowed to lecture me
on Hinduism or my Indian culture.

10
00:00:41,007 --> 00:00:42,587
(Sheldon:)I'm impressed, Raj.

11
00:00:42,759 --> 00:00:45,009
(Sheldon:)Those are very cogent
and reasonable conditions.

12
00:00:45,178 --> 00:00:47,598
(Raj:)-Thank you.
-I reject them all.

13
00:00:48,515 --> 00:00:50,265
(Raj:)Then you leave me no choice.

14
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:52,183
(Raj:)I accept the job.

15
00:00:53,353 --> 00:00:56,023
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.
I believe you've misunderstood.

16
00:00:56,231 --> 00:00:57,771
(Sheldon:)I'm not giving you the job.

17
00:00:57,941 --> 00:01:03,021
(Sheldon:)I'm simply affording you the opportunity
to apply for it.

